                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Columns as Rows.  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Starting with columnar data table, built with different metrics in various columns, map the individual metrics to the desired Actual, Target, and Variance cells within a given row of the output table. This is done by using the \"Edit\" option available in the ellipses (\"...\") menu from the upper right corner of the visual."
